        "liberapay": "tristinbaker_",
        "name": {
          "en-US": "Idle Fantasy"
        },
        "summary": {
          "en-US": "Idle RPG: train skills, fight dungeons, craft gear. No ads, no accounts."
        },
        "description": {
          "en-US": "Idle Fantasy is a free and open source offline idle RPG inspired by classic MMORPGs. Train skills, fight in dungeons, craft gear, and complete quests. No internet connection, account, or ads required.\n\n<b>Features</b>\n\n• <b>23 trainable skills</b>: Mining, Fishing, Woodcutting, Farming, Thieving, Smithing, Cooking, Fletching, Crafting, Firemaking, Runecrafting, Herblore, Construction, Prayer, Mercantile, Agility, Slayer, Attack, Strength, Defense, Ranged, Magic, and Hitpoints\n\n• <b>Session-based training</b>: Start a session and close the app. Come back up to an hour later to collect your loot and XP. Agility reduces session time.\n\n• <b>29 dungeons</b>: Fight solo bosses and enemies to earn combat XP, coins, and rare drops. Equip weapons and armour to deal more damage.\n\n• <b>Crafting system</b>: Smelt bars, cook fish, fletch bows and arrows, craft jewellery. Consume gathered materials and earn XP and items.\n\n• <b>Prayer</b>: Bury bones collected from combat to earn Prayer XP.\n\n• <b>Equipment system</b>: Equip weapons, armour, tools, and jewellery to boost stats and skill efficiency.\n\n• <b>Quest system</b>: 189 quests spanning all skills. Earn XP rewards on completion.\n\n• <b>Pet system</b>: Rare pets can drop while training skills. Each pet provides a permanent XP boost to their linked skill.\n\n• <b>Achievements</b>: Track milestones across levelling, combat, quests, and collections.\n\n• <b>NPC Shop</b>: Buy supplies and sell your gathered resources for coins.\n\n• <b>No ads. No accounts. No internet required.</b> Your save data stays on your device.\n\n• <b>Translations</b>: Partial and full translations available for 18 languages.\n\nIdle Fantasy is free software released under the GPL-3.0 licence. Source code is available on the project repository.\n\n<b>Get updates faster</b>\n\nAdd the official Idle Fantasy repository to F-Droid to receive updates as soon as they are released, instead of waiting for the main F-Droid index to catch up.\n\n1. Open F-Droid and go to Settings → Repositories\n2. Tap + and paste: https://idlefantasy.tristinbaker.xyz/fdroid/repo\n3. Search for Idle Fantasy, open the app page, and under Repositories set Idle Fantasy as the preferred source.\n"
        },
